66	225,955,1275,1458	66. Bulb and lower Leaves of a Lily.	A Lily bulb of close, thick overlapping scales with roots below, sending up a spreading tuft of long, curving leaves of the season.
67	1490,525,1740,1450	67. Leaf, lower end cut off.	A single long Lily leaf with its blade bent over at the top and its narrow stalk widening below into a thick base, cut straight across.
